WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.080
Be proud.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.300
You finally dropped the first layer of your mask.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.050
Kasuga-kun?

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.690
Saeki-san...

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.370
Let's break up.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.670
Why?

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.550
I'm sorry.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:18.360
Goodbye!

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.600
Kasuga-kun!

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.800
The picture

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:31.980
on the cover of <i>Flowers of Evil</i>...

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.820
It was on the floor.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:49.460
<b>Flowers of Evil 
Baudelaire</b>

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.460
You did it, didn't you?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.490
The classroom...

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.720
My gym uniform...

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.860
It was all you, wasn't it?

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.990
I refuse to break up.

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:19.900
I'd never break up with you.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.060
But I...

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.190
I...

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.970
But... But...

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:42.810
Do you not like me anymore?

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.720
Think it over one more time.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:47.240
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:47.240
<b>Episode 9 of 13</b>

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:23.360
Why?

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:24.930
I'm

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:27.160
such a sick person...

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:31.290
So I told Kasuga-kun that you 
wanted to have sex with him.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:31.790
Huh?

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.370
I don't understand!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.380
I don't understand how you feel!

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.240
Are you responsible for 
everything that's happened?

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.750
First time we've all gone home at once.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.110
I'm kinda nervous...

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.170
Man, this sucks...

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:34.000
I bet my parents won't let me 
out of the house for a while.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.630
Yeah, I'm in the same boat.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.000
Stay on the sidewalk.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.790
I feel bad for Saeki-san.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:46.940
I wonder what that gym uniform went through.

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:49.930
Idiot.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:00.160
Hey, should I use my air gun 
to catch that pervert?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.670
If you think you can...

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.720
Come out, you freak!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.690
Welcome home, Takao.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.400
Was everything okay at school?

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.440
I heard that degenerate appeared again.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.770
It's so scary to think about...

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.630
What's wrong with your school's security?

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.960
You won't be able to focus on your studies.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:36.280
Takao?

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.560
I don't feel well. 
I'm gonna go lie down.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.140
Why?

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:59.660
Why doesn't she hate me?

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.330
Saeki-san...

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:04.440
I'm

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.270
such a sick person...

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.430
I...

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.460
I...

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.270
I don't understand...

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:38.570
I don't understand.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.610
<i>I want to run away.</i>

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:45.610
<i>Somewhere far away...</i>

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:49.900
<i>To some town where nobody knows me...</i>

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.570
Aoki.

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:13.570
Here.

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:14.720
Abe.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:15.550
Here.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.270
Ueno.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.260
Here.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.340
Urabe.

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:20.330
Here.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.700
Okuda.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.520
Here.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:26.770
Kasuga is sick today...

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:28.700
Kinoshita.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.270
Here.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.120
Gouda.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.060
Here.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.150
Kojima.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.330
Here.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.440
Saito.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.380
Here.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.900
Saeki.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:39.950
Here.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.930
Feels weird to be in a different classroom.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:46.040
Yeah...

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.650
Hey, I heard they're cleaning up our classroom.

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.000
Let's go check it out.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.020
Nakamura-san...

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:15.020
Have you known about Kasuga-kun all this time?

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:20.590
Yep.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:25.090
Why did you ask me to be your friend?

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.650
Was it a lie?

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.650
Not really... I was just bored.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:36.880
So I told Kasuga-kun that you 
wanted to have sex with him.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:37.500
Huh?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.970
Wh-Why?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.020
It sounded like what you wanted.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:44.730
And I wanted to see how 
Kasuga-kun would react...

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:52.530
Nakamura-san, what is your 
relationship with Kasuga-kun?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.590
We have a contract.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.650
Kasuga-kun's a twisted pervert.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:06.630
It's a contract to get him 
to expose what really he is.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.090
That isn't...

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:12.820
That isn't...

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:17.720
Kasuga-kun isn't a pervert!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.220
Oh, really?

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:26.510
To me, he looks like the 
biggest pervert in this town.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.710
Takao?

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:53.030
Are you okay?

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:54.420
I brought you some apple slices.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.670
Not hungry.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.550
You haven't eaten since yesterday.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.930
Say, Takao...

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.270
I want to ask you someth—

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.670
Coming!

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:20.980
Oh...

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.750
Uh, hello.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:26.340
I'm Saeki. 
I'm in Kasuga-kun's class.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:27.660
Oh, it's a pleasure.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.010
Takao?

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.180
Saeki-san is here to see—

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:34.490
Wait! Tell her to wait a while longer!

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:36.580
Eh?

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:37.840
What's wrong?

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.840
Please!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:39.760
Tell her...

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.550
Tell her I can't see her right now!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.580
But...

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.750
Honestly...

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.490
I'm sorry.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.060
Takao still isn't feeling well.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.240
Oh...

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.280
Thank you for coming.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.480
Saeki-san...

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:17.670
Kasuga-kun!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.130
Kasuga-kun, can you hear me?

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.300
I don't understand!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:30.020
I don't understand why you did those things.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.730
I don't understand how you feel!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:37.960
I'm sorry...

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:40.030
I'm sorry.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.450
I was...

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.140
I was

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:55.670
happy about what you did with my uniform!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.380
You did it

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.540
because you liked me, right?

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.590
That's just the way guys are...

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:11.280
I'm more upset

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.980
about the fact that you hid it from me!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.490
So tell me!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.340
Me,

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.610
not Nakamura-san!

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:24.990
Talk to me!

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.570
Help me to understand

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.270
what's going through your mind!

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.100
Tomorrow...

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:41.040
Come to school tomorrow.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.170
I'll be waiting...

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.090
I'll be waiting!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.170
Takao,

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.120
what have you done?

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.540
I want an explanation.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.590
I found this

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.980
in the washing machine.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.010
Why are your clothes so dirty?

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:13.400
Are you responsible for 
everything that's happened?

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.000
Takao!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.320
<i>Nowhere.</i>

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.960
<i>There's nowhere...</i>

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.280
<i>Nowhere for me.</i>

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.760
<i>There's</i>

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:39.940
<i>nowhere...</i>

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.960
<i>There's nowhere in this town.</i>

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.040
<i>Nowhere...</i>

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.260
<i>Nowhere...</i>

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.590
<i>Nowhere!</i>

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.660
You're late, Kasuga-kun.

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:28.330
Hey, Kasuga-kun...

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.860
Don't just sit there. 
Say something amusing.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:40.010
What should I do?

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.130
Huh?

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:43.630
It's been exposed.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.400
It's all been exposed...

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.250
To my parents.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.310
I can't go home...

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.680
I have nowhere to go.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.200
Can't go home...

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.910
Or to school.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:10.380
Or to Saeki-san...

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.740
Takao!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:22.870
Takao!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.970
If you're there, say something!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.710
Takao!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.540
Takao!

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:41.430
Is that your mother?

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.160
What an idiot.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.680
So...

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.130
Let's go, then.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.130
Wh-Where are we going?

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:08.790
To the other side.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.260
Come this way.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.420
Is that

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.280
mine?

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.150
That's right.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:45.440
Remember when you scampered 
off like a stupid little mouse?

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:46.790
You left it behind.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.540
<i>If you don't want me to tell everyone, 
then take me beyond those mountains.</i>

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:02.880
If you've got a reason to stay in this 
nauseating town, what is it?

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.520
Nakamura-san...

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.440
You'll come with me?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:17.490
You're the one who's coming 
with me, scumbag.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.170
Ah, excuse me!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.350
Oh, you're Mrs. Kasuga.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.800
Have you seen my son?

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.660
What? Takao-kun?

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:11.790
No, I haven't seen him...

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:12.900
Is something wrong?

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.120
Has something happened?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.110
Well, he just suddenly took off...

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:18.170
Huh?

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.860
Oh, never mind.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:21.300
Thank you very much!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.790
Kasuga-kun...

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:23.900
There's nothing in this town...

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:25.180
Maybe there's nothing on the other side.

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:25.180
Why do you like this book?

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:26.580
If I stay here, there's no hope for me.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:26.580
I don't understand.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:29.970
Spend the rest of your life rotting in 
this town like the shit-face you are.

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:29.970
What's going on in your heart?

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:30.570
The town looks so small from here.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:32.930
Kasuga-kun! Kasuga-kun!

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:32.930
Kasuga-kun... Kasuga-kun!

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:36.060
I am an empty person.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Ready, set, 3! 
